## 📐 Architecture Layer Boundaries

```text
lib/
├── core/                → Shared utilities, network client, base error types, theme
├── shared/              → Shared reusable UI widgets, dialogs, extensions
└── features/            → Feature-First Modules
    └── <feature_name>/
        ├── data/        → DTOs, Data Sources, Repository Concrete Implementations
        ├── domain/      → Entities, UseCases, Repository Abstract Interfaces (ZERO Flutter)
        └── presentation/→ UI Pages, Widgets, Notifiers/Blocs/Controllers
```
